# The score from a normal game start (seed 1, the south coast village): it wakes
# with the coast's drone and air, the arrival phrase plays, the pad comes in, a
# machine closing in quickens the pulse and raises the dissonance, the score
# resolves once the machine is gone, and walking to the pylon by the village
# brings in the installation's grid. Stems bake while it runs, so it is slow on
# a first run and quick once the disk cache holds them. The log shows every
# layer entering and leaving ("tour score ...").
#   TOUR_TIMEOUT=900 tools/tour.sh tours/score.tour
coast calm
await score 150
shot 01-the-score-wakes
await score_phrase 90
await score_pad 300
shot 02-the-pad-has-come
spawn runner
await score_tense 90
await score_dissonance 60
shot 03-a-machine-closing-in
coast calm
await score_resolve 120
shot 04-resolved
# North-west along the village to the pylon twelve tiles off.
walk -0.35,-0.94 3.4
await score_grid 150
shot 05-by-the-pylon
